{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415487","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415487","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041548701:1":{"text":"戴蒙又跑到哪里去了？这孩子，真让人担心……","source_cn":"戴蒙又跑到哪里去了？这孩子，真让人担心……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56F2B27646554E39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041548702:1":{"text":"你在找你的孩子吗？","source_cn":"你在找你的孩子吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC560EAC560CCE75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041548703:1":{"text":"你看到一个身上缠着绷带的小男孩了吗？","source_cn":"你看到一个身上缠着绷带的小男孩了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84903DBC7230F466","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041548704:1":{"text":"老实说，没有。","source_cn":"老实说，没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6B77201EBE164DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041548705:1":{"text":"那这与你无关。","source_cn":"那这与你无关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19BDC9B5DB32F7CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041548706:1":{"text":"我明白我明白，孩子们就是如此淘气。","source_cn":"我明白我明白，孩子们就是如此淘气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB05BE5BCE5347D61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041548707:1":{"text":"我也有孩子，太能理解你的心情了。","source_cn":"我也有孩子，太能理解你的心情了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB67399CB7D4E557E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041548708:1":{"text":"你的孩子……？","source_cn":"你的孩子……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09A93968294DAC80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041548709:1":{"text":"一只调皮的小狐獴，总是闯祸，还咬人呢，现在也不知道偷跑去哪玩了。","source_cn":"一只调皮的小狐獴，总是闯祸，还咬人呢，现在也不知道偷跑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C2B874A0214926B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041548710:1":{"text":"所以我很能理解你的焦急，可以跟我说说。","source_cn":"所以我很能理解你的焦急，可以跟我说说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEC0D8BB34028288","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041548711:1":{"text":"……我在找我的儿子戴蒙，我一转头他就不见了，估计是又跑到哪里去玩了。","source_cn":"……我在找我的儿子戴蒙，我一转头他就不见了，估计是又跑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF22F6DD13D126163","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041548712:1":{"text":"这孩子，至少应该在出门前先跟我说一声啊。","source_cn":"这孩子，至少应该在出门前先跟我说一声啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x088560D121941996","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041548713:1":{"text":"我懂我懂，小家伙们一声不吱就消失实在不让人放心。","source_cn":"我懂我懂，小家伙们一声不吱就消失实在不让人放心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x375A745D75B06965","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041548714:1":{"text":"那么，你是位经验丰富的家长了？或许我可以听听你的建议……","source_cn":"那么，你是位经验丰富的家长了？或许我可以听听你的建议……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x525A3A6230837C7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:雪米拉":{"text":"雪米拉","source":"雪米拉","status":"source"},"speaker:阿熏":{"text":"阿熏","source":"阿熏","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":2}}